flowchart TD
  Start[Purchase request]
  Budget{Enough budget?}
  Self{Requester and approver are the same?}
  Amount{Request amount}
  Reject[Reject for insufficient budget]
  Reassign[Reassign approver]
  Auto[Auto approve]
  Team[Wait for team lead approval]
  Dept[Wait for department head approval]

  Start --> Budget
  Budget -- No --> Reject
  Budget -- Yes --> Self
  Self -- Yes --> Reassign
  Self -- No --> Amount
  Amount -- Under KRW 100,000 --> Auto
  Amount -- Under KRW 1,000,000 --> Team
  Amount -- Over KRW 1,000,000 --> Dept
